/.claude/settings.local.json
/.idea/
__pycache__/
.agent-config/

# Per-session planning / review scratch. These accumulate over time; the
# wildcards keep the committed tree clean without needing per-file edits.
PLAN-*.md
Review-*.md
CodexReview.md
# Reviewers write to a dotted temp file and rename it over the target, so a
# run killed in between leaves one behind. The leading dot keeps it out of
# `Review-*.md` above, and a later `git add -A` would otherwise commit it.
.Review-*.tmp.md

# Local-only archive of shipped planning docs and review logs. Move old
# PLAN-*.md / Review-*.md / CodexReview.md here at release time to declutter the root.
/archive/
